Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc1, tzdata, libqt5core5a, libqt5gui5, libqt5widgets5, libqt5sql5, libqt5sql5-sqlite, libqt5dbus5
Description: KylinList task and checklist manager
 KylinList provides local task, checklist and schedule management.
 It includes Markdown details, subtasks, reminders and desktop notes.
 麒麟清单以任务和清单为核心，桌面便签只是任务的展示方式。
